## {{ .IDPrefix }}-001: Emergency Stop
```attr
status: draft
safety-level: ASIL-D
verification-method: test
owner: Safety Team
```
The system shall provide an emergency stop function that halts all motion
within 100 ms of activation.

*Rationale: ASIL-D classification requires the highest level of safety integrity. The emergency stop must be verified by testing under worst-case load conditions.*

## {{ .IDPrefix }}-002: Brake Light Indication
```attr
status: draft
safety-level: ASIL-B
verification-method: inspection
